OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMostly dry
OL,6,Fand cloudy this evening, but a band of
OL,7,Fheavy rain reaches western coasts
OL,8,Faround midnight, spreading east
OL,9,Fovernight. Strong southeasterly winds
OL,10,Fbring coastal gales or severe gales.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FCloudy with heavy rain soon
OL,13,Fclearing eastwards in the morning.
OL,14,FThis leaves a largely dry afternoon
OL,15,Fwith sunny spells developing, but also
OL,16,Fsome showers. Breezy with strong winds
OL,17,Fover Argyll.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
