OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FMostly dry with sunny spells Thursday,
OL,7,Fcloudier with rain spreading east
OL,8,Fovernight. Variable cloud Friday with
OL,9,Frain or showers. Largely dry with
OL,10,Fbright spells Saturday. Breezy at
OL,11,Ftimes.
